  <static seed="4" source="Library/SUNYSB/oneToOneOnto1.pg">
    <statement><p>For each of the following functions, 
    <m>f:\textbf{R}\longrightarrow\textbf{R}</m> state whether they are one-to-one,
    onto, both or neither. 
    Use the following key:</p>
<p><ol>
<li>
<p><m>f(x)=e^x</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>f(x)=x^3+6</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>f(x)=x(x-6)(x+6)</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>f(x)=\left|x\right|</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>f(x)=\sin(x)</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>f(x)=x^2+4</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>f(x)=x + 4\left|x\right|</m></p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</statement>
